{"ref":"BDB, מְלֵאָה","hw":"מְלֵאָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְלֵאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. fulness, full produce</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:27\" href=\"/Numbers.18.27\">Nu 18:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.9\">Dt 22:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלֵאָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:28\" href=\"/Exodus.22.28\">Ex 22:28</a>; = <em>full produce</em> of field <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:28\" href=\"/Exodus.22.28\">Ex 22:28</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הַזֶּרַע</span> <em>the full produce of the seed</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.9\">Dt 22:9</a>; of winepress <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:27\" href=\"/Numbers.18.27\">Nu 18:27</a>.","next":"BDB, מִלֻּאָה","prev":"BDB, מְלֹא"}